Regarding using a wish on SDSM: it sounds like you want to wear an
"oLS and #twoweapon so therefore you'll need to wear SDSM to have
reflection.  If you have not yet visited the castle make sure to check
out the dragon population there before you go wishing for a new set of
armor.  Also, if Ludios is generated you might find a set of silver
dragon scales there, too.
If you're going to polypile you can try to acquire a cloak of magic
resistance that way.  The wand spoiler was really helpful for me in
learning how to polypile.  It is however IMO an expensive use of a
wish since the only thing you can count on from polypiling is causing
things to vaporize.


